    "日记写在这张照片的说明里，删除照片后日记也会一起删除。照片会移到“最近删除”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The entry is stored in this photo’s caption, so deleting the photo deletes the entry too. The photo will move to Recently Deleted."
